quirk_not_loaded.description:
Zigbee Home Automation (ZHA) is not using the SmartWings quirk for these shades:

{shades}

Another quirk for these shades may take precedence, such as a file in your ZHA custom quirks folder. Remove that quirk, then restart Home Assistant.

quirk_not_loaded_quirks_off.description:
Zigbee Home Automation (ZHA) is not using the SmartWings quirk for these shades:

{shades}

ZHA's quirks are turned off (`enable_quirks: false` in the `zha:` section of `configuration.yaml`), so SmartWings does not add its quirk. To use it, remove that line, then restart Home Assistant.
